- Everything under thirdparty/ (XenosRecomp, and later others) is under its
  own license, in its LICENSE file or source headers.

This repository contains nothing from Project Gotham Racing 4: no game data,
no code recompiled from its executable and no shaders extracted from it. Those
are generated from the user's own copy at build time and are never committed.
The game's code, shaders and assets belong to their owners and are not covered
by any license here.
